<div class="container">
  <div class="about-block">
    <h2><i class="fas fa-history"></i> Our Foundation</h2>
    <p>Ekklesia Arise Global Ministry was established through the vision and calling of Dr. Berhanu Habte. In 1964 E.C., while in prayer, the Lord showed him the map of Ethiopia and spoke: <em>"You have a national (gospel) calling. Therefore, depart from evil."</em> This marked the beginning of a lifelong journey of equipping the Church for revival and discipleship.</p>
    <p style="margin-top:1rem;">In 1983, during an international conference in England, the vision was reaffirmed through Isaiah 11:9: <em>"For the earth will be filled with the knowledge of the Lord as the waters cover the sea."</em> Dr. Berhanu then committed fully to ministry, and Ekklesia Arise was born.</p>
  </div>

  <div class="about-block">
    <h2><i class="fas fa-bullseye"></i> Vision & Mission</h2>
    <p><strong>Vision:</strong> The earth filled with the knowledge of God, and lives transformed into His likeness.</p>
    <p style="margin-top:0.5rem;"><strong>Mission:</strong> Equipping the church through teaching and training to preach the gospel and make disciples effectively.</p>
  </div>

