    <p>Inspired by Acts 19:9, the Tyrannus School is a 4-week residential training program. It covers Sonship, Christian Ethics, Spiritual Warfare, The Triumphant Church, and more. <strong>10 cohorts</strong> have graduated so far, equipping leaders for the harvest.</p>
